\par\b\fs28 \u167?7. Podcast translation\b0\fs24\par


\par Core in one sentence: in Ki Tavo you bring the first back because all is gift \u8212? and the joy in it is no atmosphere but the test of whether you still remember Who gave it.\par


\par Image: the basket with the first fruit, and the story of grace spoken aloud as you set it down \u8212? \u8216?a Syrian ready to perish was my father\u8217?.\par


\par Question to carry: do I serve out of joy over what I received, or out of duty and my own strength \u8212? and do I still remember from Whom it comes?\par


